The two scripts in this directory (omarchy-agent-usage-claude,
omarchy-agent-usage-update) are from the Omarchy project:

    https://github.com/omacom/omarchy

Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson
Licensed under the MIT License (see the parent LICENSE file).

omarchy-agent-usage-update carries a small local patch from the original:
it locates sibling omarchy-agent-usage-* collectors relative to its own
script directory instead of requiring $OMARCHY_PATH, so the pair works
standalone on any system, not just Omarchy.
